menu "Sprout feature modules"

config FEATURE_OFFLINE_POLICY
    bool "Enable fleet offline download policy"
    default y
    depends on FEATURE_CONFIG_STORE
    help
        Applies the platform-wide offline download policy: whether offline
        playback is allowed, how many packages and how many bytes the device
        may cache, how long a cached package stays valid, and whether large
        downloads stay on Wi-Fi. The policy is published once for the whole
        fleet, so every bound device shares one cache budget.

endmenu
